      "fact": "Tuesday 14 May and the payment deadline of Friday 3 May are fine, but the message says pick-up is 'back at school at 3.15pm as normal' — if normal school pick-up is earlier, this is internally ambiguous only if known; the actual unnoticed fact: the note never says when children should arrive or where to meet, but more concretely the note says payment is due Friday 3 May while the trip is Tuesday 14 May — no conflict. The real fact: the message gives no morning meet time or meeting place, which parents will need.",
