      "fact": "The message says 'next Wednesday 17th' without a month, but that's resolvable. The unnoticed material fact: Dana is coordinating food but the message asks a volunteer to bring cupcakes while Maya's mum brings sandwiches — there is no stated plan for who collects money or supplies if no one volunteers. Concrete embedded fact: the party 'starts 2.30' but 'parents welcome from 2.15' — parents would arrive before the party starts, which is intended. Actual single fact: the message gives no end time or pick-up arrangements, which parents collecting children will need.",
