      "fact": "The family wedding is in Portugal, but the letter says Leon 'will be back in class on Monday 13 October' — if they are abroad until Friday 10 October, returning to class the following Monday is plausible. The unnoticed fact: the letter promises to collect missed homework but gives no contact for how it will be sent — weak. Real embedded fact: the trip covers five school days for a wedding, but the letter never states the wedding date or travel days, so the school can't tell which days are actually needed for the event versus holiday — something a head deciding on authorisation would consider.",
