      "fact": "Twelve classes across four volunteers over two days is fine. The unnoticed fact: 38 children read aloud across twelve classes — an average of just over three per class, which is plausible. Real embedded fact: 'old Mr Fenwick' — referring to a volunteer as 'old Mr Fenwick' in a thank-you email, especially if it might be forwarded or sent as one email to all four, is unkind and could offend.",
